{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f63510fd-f66b-4a2f-b58e-2584bded07ac",
    "name": "CoffeeNChill Part 3 - API Gateway (JWT & Roles)",
    "description": "CLDV6212 Part 3 - end-to-end tests for the CoffeeNChill API Gateway.\n\nRun the whole collection in order (Run collection). Folder 01 registers a Staff and a Customer user and saves their JWTs into {{staffToken}} and {{customerToken}}. Each later folder sends Authorization: Bearer {{token}} for its role:\n- 02 No token -> 401\n- 03 Customer token -> 403 on Staff/Admin endpoints\n- 04-07 Staff token -> 200/201/202/204\n\nSet {{baseUrl}} to http://localhost:5000 for the local Docker stack or http://40.127.11.155:5000 for the live VPS.\n\nAuthor: Tahir Ismail - ST10471483",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Register and Log In",
      "auth": {
        "type": "noauth"
      },
      "description": "Creates a Staff and a Customer user, checks the validation rules and logs both in. The login tests save the JWTs into {{staffToken}} and {{customerToken}} automatically.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Staff user",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Unique values for this run, so the collection can be run again without duplicate errors.",
                  "const runId = Date.now().toString().slice(-6);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"runId\", runId);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"staffEmail\", \"staff\" + runId + \"@coffeenchill.co.za\");",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"staffUsername\", \"staff\" + runId);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"customerEmail\", \"customer\" + runId + \"@coffeenchill.co.za\");",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"customerUsername\", \"customer\" + runId);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"sku1\", \"PMC-\" + runId.slice(-3));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"sku2\", \"PMP-\" + runId.slice(-3));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status is 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Registers a Staff user. The PartitionKey in the Users table is the role.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Tahir\",\n  \"surname\": \"Ismail\",\n  \"email\": \"{{staffEmail}}\",\n  \"username\": \"{{staffUsername}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"confirmPassword\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"role\": \"Staff\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
